Incorporated code
-----------------

- compd (services/compd) incorporates code from y5 / Nourish,
  https://github.com/y5-snowies/nourish, Copyright (c) 2026 Yarden Apelker,
  licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0 and redistributed under the same terms. Its
  copyright line is carried in LICENSE-MIT.

The MixOS logo and favicons (share/brand) are not covered by the code licence
above. They are preliminary and their licence is not yet decided.

Third-party vendored code under vendor/ keeps its own licence files, and each
directory records its upstream base and local patches (vendor/README.md).

Third-party assets and licences in the compd binary
----------------------------------------------------

One line per asset or licence that the build embeds, compiles in or links.
Only what the workspace members reach is listed.

- Inter 4.001 variable font (vendor/font/Inter-VariableFont_opsz,wght.ttf,
  embedded by ui): Copyright (c) 2016 The Inter Project Authors
  (https://github.com/rsms/inter), SIL Open Font License 1.1, vendor/font/OFL.txt.
- Iced-Icons.ttf (vendor/iced/graphics/fonts, embedded unconditionally by
  iced_graphics): ships with iced under its MIT licence (vendor/iced/LICENSE);
